OL,3,GNEWSA'I died twice', says man saved by
OL,4,Aoff-duty police sergeant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dad who suffered a cardiac arrest and
OL,7,Fcollapsed in a shop said his
OL,8,F12-year-old son could have lost his dad
OL,9,Fif a "hero" off-duty police officer had
OL,10,Fnot saved him.
OL,12,FJames Ashley, 52, from Merthyr Tydfil,
OL,13,Fhad just finished parkrun and was
OL,14,Fshopping in Cwmbran when he was hit by
OL,15,Fa "wave of dizziness" and fell to the
OL,16,Ffloor on 4 April.
OL,18,FSgt Adam Hollings from Gwent Police was
OL,19,Fnearby and immediately started CPR.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
