OL,3,GNEWSA'I died twice', says man saved by
OL,4,Aoff-duty police sergeant
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I clinically died twice but by the
OL,7,Ftime the paramedics got there, I was
OL,8,Fsitting up talking... the difference
OL,9,Fwith Adam knowing what he was doing is
OL,10,Fthat my son didn't lose his dad as a
OL,11,F12-year-old," he said, and called him
OL,12,Fan "absolute hero".
